aginx-carrier  https://github.com/yinnho/aginx-carrier/releases/download/v0.2.1/aginx-carrier-v0.2.1-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl bbac10170c4645d0e0df374bbf10d6ca2edb8992c9cb5ce5933cff981a008d02
aginxbrowser   https://github.com/yinnho/aginxos/releases/download/aginxbrowser-v0.2.5/aginxbrowser-v0.2.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl 5561e6287d6b146a94170bb71fc2c5b0ff0e9e6cfd0aa0a8ea84a21d630a99e6
codex          https://github.com/yinnho/aginxos/releases/download/codex-v0.151.0/codex-v0.151.0-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl 56f026015ccc3ebc12895282200d89c216892bf6fa15fa7f228e6e0c6ad6ce76
